    question: "Given a DataFrame with a full_name column, how would you split it into first and last name, and how would you handle missing values and duplicate columns afterward?",
    slug: "10-given-a-dataframe-with-a-full-name-column-how-would-you-split-it-into-first-and-last-name-and-how-wo",
